Port mapping:
- Wait.remainingTicks -> OpenRaCountdown.remainingTicks.
- Wait constructor period assignment -> millisecond ceiling of accepted duration.
- Wait.Tick IsCanceling early completion -> isCanceling / Cancel().
- Wait.Tick `return remainingTicks-- == 0;` -> same expression in Tick().
- Actor/Activity scheduling -> AdvanceAcceptedSeconds invoked by existing accepted clock.
- Original Wait(N) completes on call N+1. Constructor primes call 1; the N
  remaining calls are one per accepted millisecond. Positive durations round up
  by less than 1 ms. Fractional milliseconds carry between accepted updates.
- Completion/cancellation are latched; no wall-clock, camera, actor or Unity dependency.
- WaitFor and its predicate are not reused.

